The QTAC binaries in this package statically link libftd2xx 1.4.33
(libftd2xx-static.a from libftd2xx-linux-x86_64-1.4.33.tgz), the FTDI D2XX
driver library from Future Technology Devices International Ltd.

libftd2xx is proprietary software distributed under the FTDI Driver Licence
Terms:

    https://ftdichip.com/driver-licence-terms-details/

libftd2xx in turn contains an unmodified copy of libusb (https://libusb.info),
distributed under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License, version
2.1 or later.
